Capacity [text box] - TwoLaneTrack
Type the Capacity of the TwoLaneTrack into the text box.
Remarks
The Capacity is the maximum number of Transporters that may be located on both lanes of the
TwoLaneTrack as a whole or in part at any one time.
The default value -1 stands for an infinite capacity.
